{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slotgun is a satisfying deckbuilding slot-machine game where you face off against several opponents to control the board. Roll you deck and control a cannon by timing your clicks to play the slot gun machine. Your roll will determine whether you shoot a single shot or thousands of balls. Your goal? Hit blocks to turn them into your color and dominate the board. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft</strong> your slot machine deck with a growing collection of symbols. Every symbol changes the way your cannon will fire and how many shots it will fire.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combine</strong> specific symbols for special events that can improve your deck or change the entire course of the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Control</strong> the board by turning everything to your color!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Do It Again.</strong> Multiple modes, difficulties, number of enemies, and random events make the game infinitely replayable. </p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1100360?t=1770614604","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1100360/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770614604","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1100360/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770614604","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1100360/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770614604","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3269980,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_parag